Third-party code

pomodoro_sync.py adapts the Google OAuth and Calendar API client from
Calendar Agenda (https://github.com/alexinslc/omarchy-calendar-agenda):

  Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson
  Copyright (c) 2026 Alex Lutz
  Released under the MIT License (same terms as above).

Service.qml, BarWidget.qml and DayModel.js adapt the break screen, bar widget
and helpers from Pomodoro (https://github.com/techywilbur/omarchy-pomodoro):

  Copyright (c) 2026 Wilbur Lindqvist
  Released under the MIT License (same terms as above).
